m/v/t64.5771-25/499619677_1478392700166747_8691469167511298160_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YW4FF5rRrQAQ7kNvwEqXbY2&_nc_oc=AdonB5lKNgExOzoaA1HIDVwwt0cWWOa1EQvyHY4CsNNIKkgdo1BmFS01eRHXcisE-Jo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTDjIsybkH8_Bh5A8g2M-tWTy3Adhb-2Gz7M_5AuoUUmA&oe=6B0DC2C6"}, "display_name": "ZG: Zombie Garden Defense Demo", "keywords": ["zombie", "shooter", "plants", "survival", "fps"], "long_description": "PLANT. SHOOT. SURVIVE.\n\nZG is a VR plant defense game against zombie waves. But this time\u2026 you fight too.\n\n\ud83c\udf31 Strategic Plant Defense\n\nGrow powerful plants and combine different abilities to stop massive zombie waves. \n{1897489697616756}\n\n\ud83e\udeb4 Rip Plants to Fight\n\nThings getting out of control? Grab plants straight from the ground and use them in combat. Your defense becomes your weapon. \n{27152109014399031}\n\ud83d\udd2b You Are the Defense\n\nYou don't just build it, you stand in it. Blast through huge zombie hordes in intense first-person battles. \n{1670386994104974}\n\n\ud83e\udddf Boss: Toilet Zombie\n\nA massive Toilet Zombie with earth-shaking attacks and chaotic patterns. Your plants won't be enough, every bullet matters. \n{1698736204367815}\n\nFree demo with 7 playable levels! Try the full version to unlock more plants, stronger weapons, and harder challenges.\n\nThe invasion never stops growing.\n\nYour garden is under siege.\n\nSurvive it.\n", "short_description": "ZG is a VR plant defense game against zombie waves.\nBut this time\u2026 you fight too."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digi-eden.com/page/PrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DigiEden Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.digi-eden.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534