 against zombie waves. But this time\u2026 you fight too.\n\n\ud83c\udf31 Strategic Plant Defense\n\nGrow powerful plants and combine different abilities to stop massive zombie waves. \n{1897489697616756}\n\n\ud83e\udeb4 Rip Plants to Fight\n\nThings getting out of control? Grab plants straight from the ground and use them in combat. Your defense becomes your weapon. \n{27152109014399031}\n\ud83d\udd2b You Are the Defense\n\nYou don't just build it, you stand in it. Blast through huge zombie hordes in intense first-person battles. \n{1670386994104974}\n\n\ud83e\udddf Boss: Toilet Zombie\n\nA massive Toilet Zombie with earth-shaking attacks and chaotic patterns. Your plants won't be enough, every bullet matters. \n{1698736204367815}\n\nFree demo with 7 playable levels! Try the full version to unlock more plants, stronger weapons, and harder challenges.\n\nThe invasion never stops growing.\n\nYour garden is under siege.\n\nSurvive it.\n", "short_description": "ZG is a VR plant defense game against zombie waves.\nBut this time\u2026 you fight too."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digi-eden.com/page/PrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DigiEden Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.digi-eden.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "275629210202852"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": [